# The bottom bar's motions over the made-up chats: 文件 tapped and the chats again (the ball's way, the notch's icon
# swapping between 令 and 文件's ＋); drawn up into the panel and let go on its row's first place (the bar chosen
# sliding down into the bar's place), and back; a chat opened (the bar going down) and back (coming up).
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
tapxy 133 -50
wait 1200
tapxy 50 -50
wait 1200
drag 50 -50 0 -64 1000
wait 1500
drag 50 -50 0 -64 1000
wait 1500
until 整理发布清单
tap 整理发布清单
wait 1200
back
wait 1500
